    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Surprise Snare",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "manipulate"
      ],
      "text": "Duhgik installs one of her snares prepared for quick deployment in a space that's occupied by an opponent. It must be a snare that normally takes 1 minute or less to Craft. The snare automatically triggers, but it takes a -2 circumstance penalty to any applicable save DC, as well as any attack rolls or other checks the snare attempts."
